8. Network services. The Program contacts external services only for the purposes described in the "About" and settings pages: checking for updates on GitHub (can be turned off in the settings), downloading optional components and the Vision Server add-on when you ask, channel lists, and checking the external address and port for torrents. Torrent, IPTV and other traffic goes to the addresses you open.

9. Termination. This license ends automatically if you break its terms. Then you must stop using the Program and delete your copies.

